    "refuse.clam.water": "The water keeps its counsel anyway.",
    "refuse.clam.weapon": "The blade was never a talker.",
    "refuse.cold.person": "A cold shoulder is all the Vale allows.",
    "refuse.compound.blazing": "It glows, and that is all.",
